  <h1 class="page-title">Claude Max 20x vs 5x: Weekly Limits, Burst Capacity & When the 2× Premium Pays Off</h1>
  <p class="updated\">Subscription Analysis · 21 October 2026</p>
  <p class="byline\">By the LLM CFO team</p>

  <p class="lede">Anthropic's Max 5x ($100/mo) and Max 20x ($200/mo) are the only two paid tiers above Pro. Marketing says 5× and 20× capacity — but what does that mean in actual weekly messages, throttle events, and dollars saved? This guide gives CFOs and engineering leads the decision framework.</p>

