  <h2>Hidden Cost: Shared Pool Contention</h2>
  <p>Max 20x capacity is drawn from a <strong>shared account pool</strong>. This creates a hidden risk:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>Engineer A runs a 50-sub-agent swarm → consumes 60% of account capacity</li>
    <li>Engineer B (also Max 20x) gets throttled despite light usage</li>
    <li>No per-seat isolation, no quotas, no alerts</li>
  </ul>
  <p><strong>Mitigation:</strong> Assign Max 20x seats to engineers who work on <em>different</em> codebases or at <em>different times</em>. Avoid concentrating all Max 20x seats on one team sharing a single repo.</p>

